- (Proof/Reason technique, Logic) A ${fref("journeys/programming-language-theory/concepts/proof-technique.td")} that transforms expressions by substituting equals for equals, using known equalities to reshape the ${fref("journeys/programming-language-theory/concepts/goal.td")}.
- (Formal system, Proof/Reason technique, Language feature/design, Programming paradigm) Rocq A Proof techniques in Rocq (via `rewrite`) that substitutes equals for equals using a known equality to transform the Goal.
